From 05c07912f4b0dfb7c41992a187e66a11520136b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:45:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter: add bottom-band CUDA blur

Add an NV12-only cleanup filter for obscuring clipped source graphics beneath a redesigned lower third. The filter copies the upper frame unchanged, downsamples and separably blurs only the bottom band in persistent CUDA scratch, then fuses feathered upsampling with mild luma reduction.
